<title>ABU DHABI: UAE oil policy unchanged under new minister - official.</title>
<headline>UAE oil policy unchanged under new minister - official.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil policy in OPEC member United Arab Emirates will remain unchanged under its new oil minister Obaid bin Saif al-Nasseri, a UAE official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The UAE oil policy, production and pricing is unchanged. It is not dependent on individuals and the change of oil minister does not signify in any way an alteration in UAE oil production and pricing policy,&quot; the official told Reuters.</p>
</text>
